#! file vault/users/alice/notes.txt | alice notes
#! file vault/users/alice/docs/a.txt | hello a
#! file vault/users/alice/docs/sub/b.txt | hello b
#! file vault/users/alice/other/c.txt | ccc
#! link vault/users/alice/docs/lo -> ../other
#! link vault/users/alice/docs/la -> a.txt
#! link vault/users/alice/docs/loop -> $TMP/vault/users/alice/docs
#! link vault/users/alice/docs/dangling -> nothere
USER alice
EXPORT one docs
TOC one
ALIAS d docs/..
EXPORT all @d
TOC all
EXPORT all2 . notes.txt
TOC all2
LIST exports
